1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,840
Buying one AI image means a signup and a card on file.

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:07,580
Gliana Agent. Pay per result, from your own wallet.

3
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:11,140
The home screen is a map, drawn by the product itself.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,720
Most of it is a conversation. One box reaches every model we sell.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:22,440
The agent picks one and quotes the price. Sixty seconds of music, eighteen cents.

6
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:29,080
Not only generation. Fifty tools are priced the same way. SEC filings, half a cent.

7
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:33,120
On a phone there is a second way in. The camera is the prompt.

8
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:37,980
Today's quest leads: your machine, transformed into a robot.

9
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:44,700
The exact price comes first. Four point eight cents, before anything runs.

10
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:47,400
One approval, signed in Seed Vault.

11
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:56,380
And the photograph comes back transformed. Same table, same curtain, same cable. You paid for it, you own it.

12
00:00:58,700 --> 00:01:02,780
Now stake it. One global round a day, on Solana mainnet.

13
00:01:06,700 --> 00:01:13,580
Entry is five SKR, or four if you hold a hundred, and that discount is read from your token account on chain.

14
00:01:15,500 --> 00:01:17,260
The wallet shows the same numbers.

15
00:01:18,300 --> 00:01:23,740
You are in. The pot is nineteen SKR, held by the round's own vault.

16
00:01:27,300 --> 00:01:33,140
Four machines transformed. A fan, a rice cooker, a motorbike, and yours.

17
00:01:36,300 --> 00:01:41,900
Voting is free. One per wallet, enforced by whether a program account exists.

18
00:01:45,300 --> 00:01:49,300
Payouts are permissionless. The pot pays out even if we disappear.

19
00:01:50,300 --> 00:01:52,940
It is live on the Solana dApp Store today.
